	column container_qty_flag = ```
			
			VAR currContainer = 'F_AshtonShippedDetails'[Container#] & "||" & 'F_AshtonShippedDetails'[TRIP#]
			VAR currIndex = 'F_AshtonShippedDetails'[Index]
			VAR minIndex =
			    CALCULATE (
			        MIN ( 'F_AshtonShippedDetails'[Index] ),
			        FILTER (
			            'F_AshtonShippedDetails',
			            'F_AshtonShippedDetails'[Container#] & "||" & 'F_AshtonShippedDetails'[TRIP#] = currContainer
			        )
			    )
			RETURN
			    IF ( currIndex = minIndex, 1, 0 )
			
			```
		formatString: 0
		lineageTag: 87293e6a-0021-46e1-88be-f87023ec6f1e
		summarizeBy: sum

		annotation SummarizationSetBy = Automatic

